<title>GERMANY: Buba revises German Oct industry output upward.</title>
<headline>Buba revises German Oct industry output upward.</headline>
<dateline>BONN 1996-12-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Bundesbank provided the following revised index figures for German industry output:</p>
<p> PAN-GERMAN INDUSTRY OUTPUT	  Oct 96	 Sept 96</p>
<p> Month-on-month change(pct)	 -0.8 (-1.8)    -0.5</p>
<p> Year-on-year (pct)		   +0.9 (-0.2)    -0.2</p>
<p> Index (base 1991=100)		97.9 (96.9)    98.7</p>
<p>Note - Preliminary October figures in brackets.</p>
<p>WEST GERMAN INDUSTRY OUTPUT</p>
<p> Month-on-month change(pct)	 -0.6 (-1.7)    -0.5(-0.3)</p>
<p> Year-on-year (pct)		   +0.9 (-0.3)    -0.6</p>
<p> Index (base 1991)		    94.6 (93.6)    95.2</p>
<p>EAST GERMAN INDUSTRY OUTPUT</p>
<p> Month-on-month change(pct)	 -1.4 (-2.7)    -2.1(-2.6)</p>
<p> Year-on-year (pct)		   +4.3 (+2.7)    +2.7</p>
<p> Index (base 1991)		   140.6 (138.9)  142.6(142.7)</p>
<p>NOTE - Figures are seasonally adjusted. The percentage change figures are calculated by Reuters from the indices.</p>
<p>-- Bonn newsroom, 49-228-26097150</p>
</text>
